  "body": "Weekends should be yours to enjoy. More beach walks, leisurely coffees and time with family. Less time maintaining a large house and looking after the garden. At the Mon Desir, you can make that change without giving up the space or privacy you love.\r\n\r\nElevated on the second floor, this approximately 182sqm apartment offers three bedrooms, two bathrooms and two balconies, with generous room for visiting friends and family. This tightly held apartment has been loved by its owners for more than a decade.\r\n\r\nStart your day with the morning sun sparkling off the water and birdsong from the beautiful pohutukawa. A different outlook unfolds from every angle, with sea views, natural shelter and greenery enhancing the sense of peace and privacy. Two bedrooms open onto a shared balcony overlooking the residents' pool and green spaces.\r\n\r\nEnjoy Mon Desir's renowned manicured grounds without spending your weekends tending them. Take a swim, head to the gym or wander down to the beach. Takapuna's cafés, restaurants and shops are within easy reach, making it easy to fill your days with the things you enjoy.\r\n\r\nTwo secure car parks, storage, visitor parking and a car-washing bay add everyday convenience, while beach access, the residents' pool and gym complete the lifestyle.\r\n\r\nYou've spent years looking after a home. Now it's time for a home that gives you more time for yourself.\r\n\r\nMake your move and settle in for summer at Mon Desir.\r\n\r\nTo view and download property files, please copy and paste the below link into your browser:\r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/AVXE",
